<title>ISRAEL: Israel July foreign currency reserves $17.968 bln.</title>
<headline>Israel July foreign currency reserves $17.968 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's foreign currency reserves rose by $175 million at the end of July to $17.968 billion, the Bank of Israel said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    Reserves	(in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>    July 1997	June 1997	July 1996</p>
<p>    17,968	   17,793	    8,925</p>
<p>The central bank attributed the rise to changes in the level of commercial bank deposits at the central bank as well as to government transfers.</p>
<p>--Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
